, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "ATPgzEnHAJ06lhWfZKen", "index": "a0056", "roundness": null, "seed": 1632647261, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 208842204, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790781549609, "created": 1790781549609, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "read \u2192 watermark advances", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "read \u2192 watermark advances", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "221ZPsd3iInweedZ2MTh", "type": "arrow", "x": 450, "y": 344, "width": 1, "height": 346, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "ATPgzEnHAJ06lhWfZKen", "index": "a0057", "roundness": null, "seed": 1386273718, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1250625901, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790781549609, "created": 1790781549609, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0, 28], [-28, 28], [-28, 322], [0, 322], [0, 346]], "startBinding": {"elementId": "UeK9Fel98ptSFl9MwbFU", "mode": "orbit", "fixedPoint": [0.1, 1]}, "endBinding": {"elementId": "ZznfW1TnV3tE9mOWJ4Fk", "mode": "orbit", "fixedPoint": [0.1, 0]}, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "elbowed": false}, {"id": "Nx5HUDvewrDMJUczTV1w", "type": "text", "x": 428, "y": 580, "width": 157.3, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "ATPgzEnHAJ06lhWfZKen", "index": "a0058", "roundness": null, "seed": 1292610499, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1985533586, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790781549609, "created": 1790781549609, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "media bytes: presigned\nupload, fetch via CDN", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "media bytes: presigned\nupload, fetch via CDN", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "Xl4lYJJZA6rcqKGtL6KB", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 840, "width": 1917.3000000000002, "height": 35.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#b91c1c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "ATPgzEnHAJ06lhWfZKen", "index": "a0059", "roundness": null, "seed": 692617801, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1705578971, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790781549609, "created": 1790781549609, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Follow-ups, validated: media \u2192 presigned multipart to object storage, transcode, CDN, references on the chat path. 100k groups \u2192 batch/fan-out service off Kafka, staggered, per-server delivery, pull on open for cold members, read receipts as counts.\nRead receipts \u2192 one monotonic watermark per member per conversation; 'read by N' = members with watermark \u2265 N. Gateway crash \u2192 ACK after the write means nothing lost; before the ACK the client retries with client_msg_id; idempotent.", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Follow-ups, validated: media \u2192 presigned multipart to object storage, transcode, CDN, references on the chat path. 100k groups \u2192 batch/fan-out service off Kafka, staggered, per-server delivery, pull on open for cold members, read receipts as counts.\nRead receipts \u2192 one monotonic watermark per member per conversation; 'read by N' = members with watermark \u2265 N. Gateway crash \u2192 ACK after the write means nothing lost; before the ACK the client retries with client_msg_id; idempotent.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "MtlM8Fv4TXSq9EGvqUQ3", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 905, "width": 1917.3000000000002, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "ATPgzEnHAJ06lhWfZKen", "index": "a0060", "roundness": null, "seed": 1327187508, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1598961434, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790781549609, "created": 1790781549609, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Numbers to say: 500M DAU \u00b7 ~50B msgs/day \u2192 580k/s avg, ~2M/s peak \u00b7 delivery < 200 ms (perceived as instant) \u00b7 200 B/msg \u2248 10 TB/day \u00b7 500\u20131M sockets per server \u2192 hundreds of servers \u00b7 heartbeat 10\u201330 s, TTL 2\u00d7 \u00b7 never write last_seen per heartbeat.", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Numbers to say: 500M DAU \u00b7 ~50B msgs/day \u2192 580k/s avg, ~2M/s peak \u00b7 delivery < 200 ms (perceived as instant) \u00b7 200 B/msg \u2248 10 TB/day \u00b7 500\u20131M sockets per server \u2192 hundreds of servers \u00b7 heartbeat 10\u201330 s, TTL 2\u00d7 \u00b7 never write last_seen per heartbeat.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "xN7ifupxi4g2R6Ogd6K3", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 955, "width": 1640.1000000000001, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "ATPgzEnHAJ06lhWfZKen", "index": "a0061", "roundness": null, "seed": 1921957171, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1834206791, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790781549609, "created": 1790781549609, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Kyle's delivery notes: say the design in four to six sentences first \u00b7 restate the problem as a north star \u00b7 no 'is this okay?' \u00b7 when stuck ask for focus, not the answer \u00b7 state an assumption and check alignment.", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Kyle's delivery notes: say the design in four to six sentences first \u00b7 restate the problem as a north star \u00b7 no 'is this okay?' \u00b7 when stuck ask for focus, not the answer \u00b7 state an assumption and check alignment.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "hs2aihbyG8BC1l8XzT58", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 1005, "width": 52.800000000000004, "height": 20.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "ATPgzEnHAJ06lhWfZKen", "index": "a0062", "roundness": null, "seed": 1561695202, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 736549056, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790781549609, "created": 1790781549609, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Legend", "fontSize": 16, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Legend", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "ia5PY23lRrwapRa8Kj5V", "type": "rectangle", "x": 420, "y": 1035, "width": 22, "height": 22, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f3f4f6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "ATPgzEnHAJ06lhWfZKen", "index": "a0063", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1685620408, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1289407891, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790781549609, "created": 1790781549609, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "TOJCyjfUvWspfSyo7s0c", "type": "text", "x": 450, "y": 1036, "widt